            {
              "Id": "about_text",
              "Name": "Physical Dice Mod v1.2",
              "Type": "text",
              "Default": "Use physical d20 rolls AND damage rolls in BG3.\n\n**d20 Rolls (Controls tab)**:\n1. Roll physical die\n2. Set value (1-20)\n3. Apply (F9)\n4. Make in-game roll\n\n**Damage Rolls (Damage tab)**:\n1. Roll physical damage dice\n2. Set total damage (1-80)\n3. Apply\n4. Attack in-game\n\nCommands: !setroll, !setdamage, !checkroll, !clearroll, !cleardamage",
              "Description": "",
              "Tooltip": ""
